Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how when you were a little kid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记不记得你小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you believed in fairy tales?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信童话故事？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That fantasy of what your life would be,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幻想你以后的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}white dress, prince charming,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白礼服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who'd carry you away to a castle on a hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被白马王子带走 住进山丘上的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd lie in bed at night and close your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚上躺在床上闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you had complete and utter faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打从心底深信不疑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:31.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight hours, 16 ounces of chocolate, and 32 cupcakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:31.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}8小时 16盎司巧克力 32块杯子蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they still don't taste right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}味道还是不对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, these are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:37.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才怪 这些很好吃 家政教母会以你为傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Martha Stewart would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:38.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, look where it got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:38.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 看看她的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:42.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Santa Claus, the tooth fairy, prince charming,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:42.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}圣诞老人、牙齿仙子、白马王子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they were so close, you could taste them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如此逼真 仿佛他们就在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's something missing, some specific ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}缺了点什么 少了某个食材
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why can't I remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我记不起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But eventually, you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但人终究会长大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:55.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One day, you open your eyes, and the fairy tale disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:55.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有天你睁开眼睛 童话就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, just call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 就打给她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Call your mother and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打给你妈问她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:01.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most people turn to the things and people they can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:01.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大多数人会转向信得过的人事物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want to call my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想打给我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, let's go sleep at your house tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:08.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今晚去你家睡吧
