Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:09.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, why are we always sleeping at my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们为什么每次都睡我家？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you even have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的有家吗？
