Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有什么？ - 家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With a closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有衣橱
