Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your personal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的私人物品
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you even have one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有那种家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好
