Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:28.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你们要不要吃杯子蛋糕？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:29.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Izzie made 'em. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:29.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 伊兹做的 - 不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我满喜欢这里的
