Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:35.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也说过你喜欢周遭有自己的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}sleeping in your own bed.
