Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:55.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even they think it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连他们都觉得奇怪
