Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, I've checked the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我查过日程表
