Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}德芙 你是否刚做完根管治疗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I couldn't stop bleeding after, literally.
