Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I'm stuck with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我不得不住院
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单报告一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}17-year-old female hospitalized
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本院收治的17岁女性病患
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for excessive bleeding, status post root canal.
