Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在餐厅
