Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Enough with the ferry boats. What about your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}渡轮我听腻了 你朋友呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm a surgeon. I don't have friends. - Everybody has friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是外科医生 没有朋友 - 大家都有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, who do you hang out with?
