Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:48.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- These are important questions. - Ah, important for who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:48.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这些问题很重要 - 对谁而言？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're having sex every night. I think I deserve details.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们每晚都会上床 我理应知道些细节
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You have more details than most. - See, this is going somewhere weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你比大多数人知道的都多 - 你又想扯开话题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:58.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want facts, and until I get them, my pants are staying on.
