Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:42.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As in pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:42.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猪身上那种？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the standard of care for someone in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是这种患者的标准疗程
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pig, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猪？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the other white meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也是白肉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care what you do, save my daughter's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便你怎么做 救我女儿要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm removing the lump now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在要摘除肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someone said you guys have a psychic running around here. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听说你们这里有个超能力者 是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:08.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did not even hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:08.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当你刚刚没说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Predicted someone would die on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}预知了四楼会有人过世
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ICU's on the fourth floor, people die all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重症监护室在四楼 常有患者过世
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. We're finishing up here, Mrs. Glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术快好了 葛雷斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll take this down to path
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会把这交给病理科
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and get the results of the frozen-section biopsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检验冻结活体活检
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and see you in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们两小时后见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, the guy is just playing mind games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的 他只是在玩心理游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can see further into the future than he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的预知能力都比他厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:29.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you even care about this, Stevens?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:29.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛计较这个 史蒂文斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, Mr. Walker. Does that hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃克先生 这样会疼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't feel anything until you get to my thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你碰到我大腿以前 什么感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Try wiggling your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}动一下脚趾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are they moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们在动吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有 - 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:49.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could about 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:49.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我10分钟前还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, your spine x-rays look clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的脊椎X光看上去没有大碍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:53.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You fell rock-climbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你攀岩时摔下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In Snohomish. Just a small drop. I was belayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在史诺霍米须郡摔的 跌得不重 身上绑了安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My wife and boys are on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我太太跟儿子在过来的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我到底出了什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold your legs up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}腿抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Should I be scared now? - Just try and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我该担心了吗？ - 试着放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nurse, I need a stat MRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}护士 马上带他去做核磁共振成像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Send an intern with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派一个实习医生陪他去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Make it Meredith Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫梅若迪丝葛蕾去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thick, short neck. That isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脖子又短又粗 不太妙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hard to intubate. You want me to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}管子不好插 要不要让我来？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's my patient. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我的病患 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just can't see anything. Add suction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是什么都看不到 抽吸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't break any teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别弄断牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know that, don't you think I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 你以为我不知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pulse ox down 87%.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血氧饱和度降到87％
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bag him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戴氧气罩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure you don't want me to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的不要我帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, damn it! Tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用 可恶！拿管子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:53.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:09:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's in the esophagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:09:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}插到食道里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you know an esophagus from a trachea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你连食道跟气管都分不出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:03.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it! Anatomy is all messed up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:03.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶！身体构造全搞错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you trying to kill this patient, O'Malley?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想害死这位病患吗？欧麦利？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we can send you back to practice on mannequins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我们可以叫你回去用假人练习
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's just I haven't done this much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我只是经验不够
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:15.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but when I have, it's been good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:15.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我之前都没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just I, haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我最近没…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's review the concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先复习一下概要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never take your eyes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}眼神紧盯目标
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Always know you can follow through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记住你一定可以顺着插进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't ever follow through on one of my patients, O'Malley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不准你插我的病患 欧麦利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little botox would do wonders for all those frown lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:46.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打点肉毒杆菌 就能跟这些皱纹说拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you allowed to talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以这样跟我讲话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, you're hot, in a Mrs. Livingston kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 你超辣 有亚裔熟女那种韵味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到没？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These are spikes in your temporal lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你颞叶里的棘波
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:02.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It means you have epilepsy. Not visions. Seizures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:02.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}意思就是你没有开天眼 只是癫痫发作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think I'm epileptic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:05.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我是癫痫发作？错得离谱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:05.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:08.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna order an MRI so I can take a closer look at your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:08.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会安排你做核磁共振成像 让我看清楚你的大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, there's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 想得美…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Duff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达夫先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:18.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Duff, can you see me? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:18.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达夫先生 看得到我吗？ 你听得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:20.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保持清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wouldn't have picked you for the mommy track, nurse Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没想到你要当妈妈了 护士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told you I know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说过我有天眼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This pregnancy thing, you can't run away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怀孕这种事是没办法逃避的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:49.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bailey, I want off the psychic case. I'll take whatever you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:49.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利医生 我不想治那个超能力者了 叫我做什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Can I switch? - Ask nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我能不能换？ - 好声好气地问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is me doing nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是在好声好气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I know the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我懂那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These guys want everybody to think they're a sideshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些人只是想哗众取宠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 让我治他 - 我不让人交换的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't do switches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll do your post-op notes for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮你做一个月份的术后笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. I can accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那样我可以接受
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie, you get psych guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 超能力者交给你 你今天走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:10.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yay. This is your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get to be with me on the breast cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:12.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要陪我去医乳癌患者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:13.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's spotting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:13.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}病患还有点状出血 所以你要做内诊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll need to do a pelvic. She's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? This. The guy's films are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧？这家伙的片子看不出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no reason I can see for his creeping paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看不出来他的瘫痪 为什么会持续恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just so surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很讶异
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I expected an intrusion into the spinal space
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为会在脊椎间隙看到异物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or a bony spur in the nucleus pulposus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是在髓核里看到骨刺
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来你弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't always get what you expect, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是每次都会顺你的意 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你哪根筋不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me something to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}讲一点也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便都行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are your grandparents' names?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你祖父母叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我祖父母不在了 - 你在哪里长大的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:55.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where'd you grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's your favorite flavor of ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最喜欢的冰激凌口味是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where'd you spend your summer vacations?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你暑假时去哪里玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lighten up, it'll be good for your blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看开点 那样对你血压有帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, don't you tell me to lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不准你叫我看开点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll lighten up when I, feel light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想开就会看开了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't we have treatment options?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:14.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有其他治疗方案吗？ 不是每次都会有其他选择的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:14.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, aren't there always alternatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With this stage of invasive carcinoma,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}侵袭性乳癌进展到这一期了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}surgery, chemo, radiation, and drug therapy are your only options.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只能从手术、化疗、放射 和服药里面选
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I wait until the end of my pregnancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能等到生完小孩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The pregnancy hormones will likely speed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怀孕时的荷尔蒙会加快癌细胞增长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the growth of the cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}胎儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:30.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}None of these courses of treatment will allow the baby to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:30.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论用哪一种治疗方案 胎儿都保不住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. and Mrs. Glass, I understand how difficult this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛雷斯夫妇 我了解这很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No disrespect, but like hell you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无意冒犯 但你懂个鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're going to have to make a decision as to how you want to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们必须决定接下来要怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean my baby's life or my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是指要救我或救胎儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll have to evacuate the fetus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们必须取出胎儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any changes, Mr. Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有变化吗 沃克先生？ - 我现在腿完全不能动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't move my legs at all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said he was moving his legs when he came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说他入院时腿还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他出了什么问题？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The paralysis is moving quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瘫痪恶化得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and there was nothing in the MRI to explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}核磁共振成像也没看到可能原因
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Has Tommy been under any stress lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汤米最近压力大吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what's making me stressed? Being in here and not being able to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道什么事在给我压力吗？ 在这里还动不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Grey...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾医生…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Emotional trauma can be converted into something physical, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}精神创伤也能造成身体创伤 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- This is possible. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有可能 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:32.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like hysterical numbness or paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:32.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是癔病性麻痹或瘫痪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe there is no physiological reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许原因不在身体上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and he's just having a conversion reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只是有转化反应
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think it's psychosomatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以是心理影响生理？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is not in your head, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题不在你的脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I believe you. - Mr. Duff, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我相信你 - 达夫先生 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Psych sent him down. He has visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}精神科送过来的 他有天眼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我疯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:55.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna order a higher-level MRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:55.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要安排更高强度的核磁共振成像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会找出原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how important this is to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明知道这对我有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:06.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is about saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:06.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事关你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not respecting it, or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不尊重我的信仰和生命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're letting them put a pig a freaking nonkosher,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要让他们在我胸腔放一头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}traif mammal into my chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一头不纯洁的畜牲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:15.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:15.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放在我的心脏里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The very essence of my being!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我存在的核心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:19.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a porcine valve, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:19.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那其实是猪心瓣膜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care what the hell it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不管那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you give me a pig part, I might as well be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你们移植猪的器官到我体内 我不如死了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told you this whole orthodox thing was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说过不该让她接触正统派信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was wrong with being reform like everyone else we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我们认识的人一起加入改革派 有什么不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys don't even light candles on Friday nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们连星期五晚上都不点蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't even know all the passover plagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们连十灾都背不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:36.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boils, vermin, pestilence. Even I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:36.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疹灾、蝗灾、疫灾 连我都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:42.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Miss Friedman, I appreciate your extreme religious convictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:42.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}弗里德曼女士 我很佩服你如此虔诚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:43.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fire, hail...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:43.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火球和雹灾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Simply put, without this procedure, you will die.
