Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Small-and-angry was a hot appetizer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}娇小的火爆医生姿色不错 但你可是人间尤物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but you, doc, are a smorgasbord of lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Duff, you're pressing your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达夫先生 你别太得寸进尺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you press it for me?
