Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope you're not claustrophobic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你没有幽闭恐惧症
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're staring at me. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在盯着我 别盯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:29.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm looking at you sweetheart, but it's the strangest thing.
