Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm hungry for a chocolate cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好想吃巧克力杯子蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you say?
