Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:37.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃起来很松软那种 再加上…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}white squiggle on the frosting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白色的螺旋状糖霜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:39.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you oblige?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:39.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你帮得上忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, do I still have some chocolate on my face or in my hair or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我脸上还是头发沾到巧克力了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:50.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You. I know the drill, so keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:50.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂这套 继续演
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:53.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Next you'll be reading my cards, telling me my dead uncle is in the room.
