Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have a dead uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有死去的叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:16:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm watching you.
