Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- If that's turkey, can I have some? - It's soggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是火鸡的话 我可以吃吗？ - 太软烂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it'll kill you, solve everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许会害死你 那就万事大吉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could have gotten that intubation, I am good at intubations.
