Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:24.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么医院的东西都有医院的味道？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:26.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be so hard on yourself, George. Everybody makes mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:26.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别太为难自己 乔治 人非圣贤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:27.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm good at a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:27.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我多才多艺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I'm gonna tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我有事要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, George. You need to get laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 乔治 你需要打一炮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:32.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See that nurse over there?
