Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I intubated an esophagus. - Dude, you're tweaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以免你忘了 我把管子插到食道里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:41.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you should go see that psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:41.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 你在抽搐 也许你该去看那个超能力者
