Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达夫先生才不是超能力者！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go buy her a latte
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:48.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算我求你 买杯拿铁送她 发泄一下性欲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and freshen up your gonad, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:55.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:55.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not too late to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在打给她不算太晚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:00.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, moms like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:00.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老妈都喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}surprises on their birthdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生日意外打来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.75,0:18:04.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's very hallmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.75,0:18:04.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很温馨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm 47, you know? I'm 47 and having a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我47岁了耶？47岁还生小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which is kind of a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点像奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it kind of sucks, if you see what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有点讨厌 你懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'd actually given up on the kid thing about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们约一年前才放弃生小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:29.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, fertility treatments, acupuncture needles in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:29.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}助孕疗程、在我眼睛上针灸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, not really, but it felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是真的刺眼睛 但感觉很像
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was like, "screw this. I want my life back."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就想说算了 我要找回人生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then one awesome night on the beach with a bottle of Merlot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后有个美妙的一晚 在沙滩上喝着红酒…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should have these labs back in a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}报告应该几个小时后会出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你懂吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My hesitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的犹豫？
