Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这选择很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怀了小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have advanced-stage carcinoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到了癌症晚期
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're 47 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你才47岁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Statistically you have a good probability of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}照数据来看 你的存活率很高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you forego treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你放弃治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}chances are you won't see your baby go to kindergarten,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有可能会撑不到小孩上幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so whose life are you interested in saving?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你想救谁的命？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First my legs, then my stomach. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先是我的腿 然后是我的胃 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doc, my hands can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生 我的手动不了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:26.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Squeeze my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:26.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抓我的手指
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right here. No?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里呢 不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me know if you feel this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若有感觉就告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about that? Here?
