Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:39.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything here? Up here? OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:39.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有感觉吗？这里呢？好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:41.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing on this side? All right. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:41.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这边也没有吗？好 我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nurse, cancel the second MRI.
