Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If there was something to fix, wouldn't we have seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若有问题 我们早该发现了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think the MRI missed a clot in his upper spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为核磁共振成像 没照到上脊椎的血块
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna cut him open. I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:56.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我要帮他开刀 进去找 - 你搞错怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if you're wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Couldn't unnecessary spinal surgery do more damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必要的脊椎手术 不会造成更多伤害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we wait any longer, we have a paralyzed man who can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我们再不行动 等这东西扩散到脑干里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就会全身瘫痪无法呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm trusting my instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信自己的直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sometimes you got to take a chance to save a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时要冒险才能救人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:22.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your mitral regurge is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:22.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的二尖瓣逆流越来越严重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The valves are leakier than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瓣膜渗漏严重恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you hitting on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在撩我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我撩你也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hear they call you Dr. Evilspawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听说别人叫你恶魔之子医生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, only the people that like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有喜欢我的人这样叫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that explains the lack-of-faith thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪你没什么信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:42.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I kind of think of myself as a pagan, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:42.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实我自认是异教徒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}hey, that's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what it's like being a teenager these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道时下的青少年是什么样子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My friends spend most of their time screwing around and getting wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我朋友大多数时候 都在乱搞或喝得烂醉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least I have God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我有上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, so, God wants you to die, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上帝想要你死吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wants me to be passionate about what I believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要我保有虔诚的信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't believe in anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有任何信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mother used to pray to Saint Jude for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈以前会替我向圣犹达祷告
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How appropriate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真适合你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}patron saint of lost causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走投无路者的主保圣人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:17.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mmh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did an angio on my psych case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我替我的超能力者做了血管摄影检查
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The MRI came out clean, but I saw a ditzel. There's something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}核磁共振成像没看到问题 但我看到一个小结 这里有情况
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep, you're right. There's an AVM on his left temporal lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对 他的左颞叶有动静脉畸形
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll schedule the OR for tonight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我安排他今晚进手术室 - 慢一点 小妹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, back up, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's high risk of spontaneous hemorrhage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自发性出血发作的风险很高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:41.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The attending has to see the films. We need consent forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:41.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主治医生必须看过片子 我们需要取得同意书
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Believe it or not, Stevens,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}信不信由你 史蒂文斯 我们必须照规矩走 休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we have to follow protocol. Take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if the AVM looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:47.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若动静脉畸形看上去不妙 我们会治好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it's gonna blow, we fix it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If the man needs to be fixed, we'll fix him in due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若那男人需要救治 时候到了我们就会治他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:51.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you moving so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:51.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛这么急？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get too involved with your patients, Izzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:55.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你放太多感情在病患身上 伊兹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:57.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you make everything so personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:57.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛每次都夹杂私人感情？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是私人感情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pulse ox 98.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血氧饱和度98％
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've got to save this cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们必须治好这段脊髓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This guy's built like the rock of Gibraltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这家伙的皮肤跟石头一样硬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want me to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我先动刀吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna cut here from the base of the neck to the rib cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要切开脖子底部到肋骨的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to hit the bleeders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你帮我处理出血
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still don't think we should be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是觉得我们不该动刀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:26.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- This guy has a spinal hematoma... - We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:26.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这家伙有脊椎血肿… - 我们无法确定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which left untreated, are almost always fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…不处理的话 致死率非常高
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're cutting blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你根本不知道要开哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever happened to being practical?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是要务实吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need to see more here, retractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里需要更好的视野 放开创器
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:37.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脊椎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:42.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no "wow" in "practical."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:42.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喊“哇”一点也不务实
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.83,0:22:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have decided to go ahead with the evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.83,0:22:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们决定取出胎儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:55.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}管他的 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:58.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe this is how it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:58.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说不定这就是命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:01.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need to start chemo right away, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:02.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们必须马上开始化疗 - 我们会把一切准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:02.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll get everything ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:08.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever done a D&C before?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:08.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有做过刮宫术？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.79,0:23:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We learned at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.79,0:23:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在学校学过
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, uh, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:11.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll call an OB resident down to supervise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:14.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会请妇产科住院医生下来监督
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she needs anything, page me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若她有其他要求 再呼叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're using up my oxygen, O'Malley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你快把我的氧气吸干了 欧麦利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How does a pompous, cocky jackass like you always have women all over him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这种浮夸又自大的混球 怎么每次都有一堆女人倒贴？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little blue love pills, lots of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}靠很多颗蓝色小药丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轻舞如蝶 刺击如蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:56.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There it is. A bovine xenograft.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这个 移植牛类器官
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.46,0:24:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O'Malley, you think too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.46,0:24:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧麦利 你想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:05.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got to dance and jab. Dance and jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:05.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你出招要虚实相接
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like me. I am the Ali of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像我就是这里的拳王
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does the wall ever bow back?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}墙壁会回敬她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's called davening, smartass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这叫犹太祈祷 天才
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.17,0:24:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is me communing with God,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.17,0:24:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是在跟上帝沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:42.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you're interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:42.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打断我了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've found a transplant option.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我找到移植选择了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At first I thought maybe a cadaver, but they're really hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来考虑尸体移植 但那种很难找
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:51.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then I realized Dr. Burke can transplant
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:51.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我想到除了猪心以外
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}a bovine mitral valve instead of the pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:54.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生可以改移植牛二尖瓣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:56.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She can get a cow valve?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:56.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她可以移植牛瓣膜？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke, why wasn't this mentioned before?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生 你怎么没提过？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:02.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The bovine valve has only been an option the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:00.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.29,0:25:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}牛瓣膜是最近几年才有的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's a much more complicated procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术也复杂许多
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.62,0:25:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But the best part is it's superior to the pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.62,0:25:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最棒的地方是这比猪好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It lasts longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更持久
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.79,0:25:13.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What incredibly small fraction of your brain were you using in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.79,0:25:13.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底有没有用大脑想过？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.67,0:25:14.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.67,0:25:14.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.58,0:25:17.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Correct me if I'm wrong, but did you not present an alternative procedure
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.58,0:25:17.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪里说错 你是否没先跟主治医生提报
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.62,0:25:19.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}without consulting your attending first?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.62,0:25:19.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就告诉病患这个备用方案？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.17,0:25:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I thought you'd be... - What, impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.17,0:25:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我以为你会… - 很佩服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's just stupid. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你也太蠢了吧 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're finished here, Karev. You're off this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结束了 卡瑞 你不用治这位患者了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.25,0:25:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need to sign these consent forms so we can proceed with your surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.25,0:25:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你必须签同意书 我们才能进行你的手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.25,0:25:47.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetheart I'm not signing anything unless it's got my name on it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.25,0:25:47.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 要我签字 除非那东西上面写着我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.75,0:25:49.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}followed by a whole bunch of zeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.75,0:25:49.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下面还有一大堆零
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, the AVM is located in this crucial part of the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 这个动静脉畸形 就在你大脑中的重要部位
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.00,0:25:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a tangle of blood vessels that could burst and affect your speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.00,0:25:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一堆血管缠在一起 爆开的话会影响你的口语能力
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:57.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}among other things. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:57.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有其他影响 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.29,0:25:59.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We know your visions are actually seizures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.29,0:25:59.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们知道你的天眼只是癫痫发作
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.38,0:26:00.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Do you? - Do I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.38,0:26:00.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的吗？ - 什么真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Know they're seizures.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道那是癫痫发作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're really good at reading people, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很会阅读人心 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.17,0:26:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Telling them what they want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.17,0:26:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说别人想听的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.17,0:26:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's an unfortunate alignment of Saturn in the house of Jupiter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.17,0:26:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}土星跟木星宫位排列不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.83,0:26:13.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.83,0:26:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.75,0:26:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.71,0:26:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You watch people, read their body language.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.71,0:26:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你观察别人 阅读他们的肢体语言
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.33,0:26:20.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You say "chocolate cupcakes," I lean towards you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.33,0:26:20.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说：“巧克力杯子蛋糕” 我就靠近你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.42,0:26:22.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so you think you're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.42,0:26:22.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你认为自己讲对了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.42,0:26:24.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not only do you know you're having seizures,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.42,0:26:24.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不仅知道自己是癫痫发作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but you're milking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还在利用它
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.88,0:26:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.29,0:26:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we'll just see about that, Cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.29,0:26:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到时就知道了 小蟋蟀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你叫我什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.92,0:26:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna do a quick pelvic exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.92,0:26:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先做个内诊 妇产科住院医师等一下就到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The OB resident should be down soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.83,0:26:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a short procedure, your husband can stay if he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.83,0:26:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术过程很快 要的话 你先生可以留下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.21,0:26:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We changed our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.21,0:26:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们改变心意了 - 不好意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.71,0:26:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.79,0:26:50.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've decided to keep the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.79,0:26:50.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们决定留下小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.38,0:26:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you tell me I'll survive if I go through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.38,0:26:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没办法说 做完治疗我一定会活下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Having the procedure does not necessarily improve the treatment outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疗程不能保证改善结果
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.08,0:27:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have quite the bedside manner. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.08,0:27:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的一点也不修饰耶？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.71,0:27:09.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom died of breast cancer when she was in her 40s.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.71,0:27:09.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈40多岁时死于乳癌
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:10.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have that cancer gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:10.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有同一种癌症基因
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My chances are pretty much lose-lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:14.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论怎么看 我都很可能竹篮打水一场空
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.08,0:27:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}whichever way you look at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.67,0:27:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}except for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.67,0:27:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}倒是那胎儿能保住
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.75,0:27:17.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.75,0:27:17.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.12,0:27:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll call down a psych consult. - Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.12,0:27:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我去请心理治疗师来咨询 - 不必麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am going to get fat and happy instead of skinny and bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要吃得又胖又开心 而不是又瘦又秃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我走到了尽头…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Look, if you want to live... - Honey, that's what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 听好 你想活下去的话… - 亲爱的 我正有此意
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.25,0:27:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, if you think you're gonna get any, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.25,0:27:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你觉得有甜头吃 最好再想想
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没心情
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm not in the mood either. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我也没心情 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.25,0:28:00.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.25,0:28:00.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.79,0:28:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I just haven't seen you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.79,0:28:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我只是今天都没看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.83,0:28:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又怎样 我在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.21,0:28:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never done a bovine replacement before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.21,0:28:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从没动过牛体置换手术
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.50,0:28:18.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.50,0:28:18.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.71,0:28:24.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look it up, research it, and get someone to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.71,0:28:24.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去查啊 研究一下 然后找人帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.29,0:28:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a problem that has a solution, Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.29,0:28:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个问题有解答 柏克
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.08,0:28:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are a lot of problems that don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.08,0:28:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有很多问题根本无解
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.92,0:28:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Third thoracic laminae. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.92,0:28:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第三节胸椎板里没看到血肿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I see the dura pulsating here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好像看到硬膜搏动
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.42,0:28:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's not. Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.42,0:28:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看错了 继续找
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.25,0:28:47.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have been at this for 4 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.25,0:28:47.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们找了四小时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe he just injured his spinal cord, and there's nothing to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许他只是伤到脊髓 没什么好医的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.08,0:28:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Grey, when you read your books, make sure you reference them correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.08,0:28:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾 你读书时 记得要把内容读进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.54,0:28:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Progressive paralysis implies a pressure lesion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.54,0:28:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}渐进性瘫痪代表有压迫病灶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.29,0:28:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My books got me here...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.29,0:28:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我靠读书来到这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.71,0:29:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pressure's 180 over 111.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.71,0:29:04.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血压升到180／111 脉搏40多
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.50,0:29:04.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The pulse is in the 40s.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.42,0:29:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What is it? - I'm pushing 70 milligrams of diazoxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.42,0:29:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了？ - 我要打70毫克的二氮嗪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.12,0:29:08.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.12,0:29:08.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Autonomic dysreflexia.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自主神经反射异常
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.75,0:29:11.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damage to the sympathetic nervous system?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.75,0:29:11.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}交感神经系统受损？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.25,0:29:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BP and the heart rate are unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.25,0:29:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血压和脉搏不稳
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're in trouble, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:15.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们有麻烦了 对不对？ - 我们得找到血块
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.83,0:29:15.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've got to find the clot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can see the cord below the dura.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看得到硬膜下面的脊髓 他要中风了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.83,0:29:23.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Focus, Grey. We're gonna find the clot. It's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.83,0:29:23.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}专心 葛蕾 我们会找到血块的 就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Cleanup, please. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 请清除 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.29,0:29:28.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BP's still up. Heart rate's at 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.29,0:29:28.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血压还是很高 心跳44
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get on those bleeders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}控制住出血点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep looking, Dr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:36.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续找 葛蕾医生
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.75,0:29:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. O'Malley? Our patient's pulse ox is dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.75,0:29:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧麦利医生？ 我们病患的血氧饱和度在降
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's agonal. She needs to be intubated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她处于濒死期 需要插管
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:48.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't there anyone else who can do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:48.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有其他人可以帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're standing here. I could try and find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就在这 我也可以去找其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.46,0:29:52.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.46,0:29:52.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.58,0:30:01.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.58,0:30:01.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sats down to 86%. - Crich pressure, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 血氧饱和度降到86％ - 请执行环状软骨按压
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.67,0:30:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. I see cords.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.67,0:30:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到气管了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.25,0:30:10.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tube. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.25,0:30:10.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快拿管子过来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check for breath sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检查呼吸音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.17,0:30:31.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Clear and equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.17,0:30:31.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}清晰平稳
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.67,0:30:33.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CO2 detector mellow yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.67,0:30:33.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}二氧化碳监测仪显示淡黄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smooth moves, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻利得很呀 医生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.00,0:30:38.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kicked ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.00,0:30:38.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Dr. Karev.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:56.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How long would it take to get a cow valve?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:56.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多久可以弄到一个牛瓣膜？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.38,0:30:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About 60 minutes by messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.38,0:30:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下单后快递只要花60分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're scrubbing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你来实习
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you very much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常感谢你 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This doesn't get you any points, Karev.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这没有帮你加到任何分 卡瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm the only one with points around here, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有我能决定加不加分 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.21,0:31:17.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, by the way, Devo wants a rabbi to bless her before surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.21,0:31:17.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 德芙要找拉比 在手术前帮她祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.92,0:31:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.92,0:31:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.00,0:31:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You came up with the cow,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.00,0:31:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用牛器官是你的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.38,0:31:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you can find that girl a rabbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.38,0:31:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮那女孩找个拉比应该难不倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What is it? - See for yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了？ - 自己看…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the second thoracic vertebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在第二节胸椎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.75,0:31:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.75,0:31:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.42,0:31:42.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.42,0:31:42.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.88,0:31:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It really is there. - Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.88,0:31:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的有 - 当然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.04,0:31:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's suction and pack this baby, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.04,0:31:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血吸一吸 我们把这血肿弄掉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.67,0:31:53.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.67,0:31:53.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说对了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:32:00.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Is he gonna be OK? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:32:00.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他会好起来吧？ - 应该会
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.67,0:32:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We stopped the paralysis from advancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.67,0:32:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们阻止瘫痪继续恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.50,0:32:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you don't know if the paralysis he already has will be permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.50,0:32:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你不知道瘫痪的状况是不是永久的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.42,0:32:08.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.42,0:32:08.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You keep taking everything on faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.75,0:32:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你做事全凭信念
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.12,0:32:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you know what's real and what's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.12,0:32:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么分辨真假？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.08,0:32:15.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.08,0:32:15.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.08,0:32:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some people would call this a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.08,0:32:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人会称这为谈恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The kind where you exchange keys, leave your toothbrush over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}互相交换钥匙 留牙刷在对方家的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.96,0:32:25.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.96,0:32:26.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁？谁会这样说？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.25,0:32:26.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who would call it that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.54,0:32:30.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.54,0:32:30.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就会
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.58,0:32:34.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And I'm supposed to believe you? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.58,0:32:34.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就该相信你？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.42,0:32:36.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Show me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.42,0:32:36.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我看些表现
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.79,0:32:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me a reason to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.79,0:32:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我能相信的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.17,0:32:55.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have your discharge papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.17,0:32:55.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}出院保证书在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.71,0:32:58.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're not happy with me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.71,0:32:58.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是不是对我不满？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.21,0:33:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm your doctor. It's not my place to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.21,0:33:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是你的医生 我没立场开心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My husband and child are going to be together
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我死后多年 我先生和孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.62,0:33:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}long after I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.62,0:33:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}仍会在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.33,0:33:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.33,0:33:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们谈论过了 这是我们的决定 那样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.83,0:33:09.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's our decision, and that's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, why do you need my approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你为何需要我的认同？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:12.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:12.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是希望你能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不理解
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.21,0:33:30.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I brought the consent forms again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.21,0:33:30.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我又拿同意书过来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:32.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really need to sign them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:32.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的需要签
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.17,0:33:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your surgeon scheduled the OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.17,0:33:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的医生已经预订好手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Duff, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达夫先生 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.42,0:33:39.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you having another seizure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.42,0:33:39.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}癫痫又发作了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.12,0:33:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.12,0:33:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.96,0:33:46.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think maybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.96,0:33:46.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.42,0:33:50.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.42,0:33:50.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.17,0:33:57.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.17,0:33:57.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.04,0:34:01.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's about to be over.
