Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.25,0:40:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢咖啡冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.46,0:40:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}single-malt scotch,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.46,0:40:50.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}单麦威士忌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.88,0:40:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}occasionally a good cigar. I like to fly-fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.88,0:40:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}偶尔抽根好雪茄 我喜欢飞蝇钓
