Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.17,0:40:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I never dance in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.17,0:40:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从不在公开场合跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.54,0:40:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.75,0:41:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Favorite novel, The Sun Also Rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.75,0:41:03.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最喜欢的小说是《太阳照常升起》 最喜欢的乐队是冲击乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.96,0:41:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Favorite band, The Clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.75,0:41:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My favorite color is blue. I don't like light blue, indigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.75,0:41:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最喜欢蓝色 我不喜欢淡蓝色或靛色
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:08.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The scar right here on my forehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:08.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我额头上的疤
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.79,0:41:10.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that's why I don't ride motorcycles anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.79,0:41:10.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我不骑摩托车的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.83,0:41:13.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I live in that trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.83,0:41:13.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我住在那辆拖车里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.00,0:41:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All this land is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.00,0:41:18.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这块地是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.96,0:41:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no idea what I'm gonna do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.96,0:41:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全不知道要怎么利用
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.62,0:41:24.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So that's it. That's all you've earned for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.62,0:41:24.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这样 你现在只能知道这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.04,0:41:26.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The rest you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.04,0:41:26.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想知道其他的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.79,0:41:29.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}just gonna have to take on faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.79,0:41:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只能有信念
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.17,0:41:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.17,0:41:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别人偶尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.79,0:41:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}people may even take your breath away.
